  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">動態樹木</a>&nbsp;| <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex的生物模組</a></h2><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/937/369/header0.png\" alt=\"header\" width=\"1176\" height=\"480\"></h5><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/A4FCBS3\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0Prkr13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"166\" height=\"32\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>模組概述</strong></h2><p>本模組使Alex的生物模組與動態樹木相容，新增香蕉植物以及金合歡樹會掉落金合歡花。<br>樹木的外觀、行為及生成方式可透過樹木包進行自訂與調整。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>特色功能</strong></h2><h4><strong>新增樹種</strong></h4><ul>\n<li>香蕉植物</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1091039/description_41e184d2-bbc3-44f5-a63a-dfad37a73f00.png\" width=\"552\" height=\"473\"></p><p><strong>新增掉落物</strong></p><ul>\n<li>金合歡葉會掉落金合歡花</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1091039/description_9c628eda-417f-4f0e-91fd-3df5f85ebb06.png\"></p><h4><strong>世界生成&nbsp;</strong></h4><p>香蕉植物現會於叢林中自然生成</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>其他擴充模組</strong></h2><p>適用於其他模組的動態樹木擴充可在<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 動態樹木CurseForge頁面</a>中找到。</p><h4><strong>建議與請求</strong></h4><p>若需請求新增模組相容性，請至此處提交！！&nbsp;<br><a href=\"https://github.com/orgs/DynamicTreesTeam/discussions/categories/compatibility-addon-suggestions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/orgs/DynamicTreesTeam/discussions/categories/compatibility-addon-suggestions</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>需求條件</strong></h2><p>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">動態樹木<br></a>-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex的生物模組</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></h2><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>授權與模組包使用</strong></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p>您可自由將本模組用於任何模組包！無需詢問。<br>本模組採用<strong>MIT</strong>授權，原始碼公開於GitHub。</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
